00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:25.430
But it's still at like five point eight percent
this morning in the United States and about

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:27.360
7 percent worldwide.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.750
So it's possible more testing will change
that and get it back down to something like

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:32.750
a serious flu.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.870
But right at the moment, it's it's not just
a bad flu.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:37.940
It's way worse than that.

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.830
So I think the social isolation thing was
the right move.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:41.830
